"""
Devin ACP transparent passthrough + usage logger.
Installs as 'devin' in front of the real 'devin acp' binary.
Only intercepts 'devin acp'; all other subcommands are exec'd to the real binary.

jarvis: ceiling Python prototype; rewrite in Go if upstream wants a single-binary CLI.
"""

